    "                             /open takes a number too (or type",
    "                             the number alone, no /open needed)",
    "/list                        every tagged command and its start command",
    "/open <name-or-number>       start one, right here in this session",
    "/newsession <command...>     start one in a brand new, independent Termux session",
    "/sessions                    list running claude sessions -- more than",
    "                             one at once is what caused the last freeze",
    "/sessions kill <pid>         close one",
    "/updates                     check every project here against GitHub",
